<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-SUGIYAMA, KRAJICEK WIN JAPAN OPEN FINALS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SUGIYAMA, KRAJICEK WIN JAPAN OPEN FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final results for the week-long</p>
<p>$1.22 million Japan Open at Ariake Tennis Forest Park near Tokyo</p>
<p>Bay on Sunday:</p>
<p>Final women's singles</p>
<p>4-Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat 3-Amy Frazier (U.S.) 4-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Final men's singles</p>
<p>1-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat 16-Lionel Roux (France)</p>
<p>6-2 3-6 6-1</p>
</text>
